    <string name="website_rules_info_body">Website rules are profile-specific and apply only while this profile is active.\n\nUse the master switch to temporarily disable website rules without removing your domains. In Block selected mode, selected domains are blocked. In Allow selected mode, selected domains are allowed.\n\nWebsite blocking reads the visible URL from supported browsers through Accessibility. Supported/tested browsers include Chrome, Brave, Edge, Opera, Samsung Internet, Firefox, Waterfox, Kiwi, Vivaldi, DuckDuckGo, and Ecosia. Support can still vary by browser version and device.</string>
